                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e4a97170-7f2f-3ab3-88b5-f31c356b3858",
                        "entry_id": "44e3575c-e06e-3082-9f1d-b911ffea2d1b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "транспортное средство на широких резиновых гусеницах и паре лыжных полозьев, используемое для перемещения в условиях зимнего бездорожья"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "575436cd-7a53-4a0f-95a5-24ac339eb32c",
                                "sense_id": "e4a97170-7f2f-3ab3-88b5-f31c356b3858",
                                "text": "У лесничих должна быть хорошая техника для передвижения: вездеходы ― летом, снегоходы ― зимой, даже вертолёты ― для чрезвычайных происшествий."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "48c08ade-4d3a-4520-9bf6-ea884f6a1c71",
                        "source_entry_id": "44e3575c-e06e-3082-9f1d-b911ffea2d1b",
                        "source_sense_id": "e4a97170-7f2f-3ab3-88b5-f31c356b3858",
                        "target_lang_word": "snowmobile",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "snowmobile",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a1ce6fd-ac00-3d5b-90e7-05b3bfa6f3e1",
                                        "entry_id": "96812052-39b4-3006-bfb5-b69088583a83",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A vehicle with skis at the front and a caterpillar track at the rear, used for travelling over snow, sometimes as sport."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80e02f3a-f030-4765-9460-1611770a28c3",
                                                "sense_id": "7a1ce6fd-ac00-3d5b-90e7-05b3bfa6f3e1",
                                                "text": "From the manufacture of snowgoing equipment such as snow cats, it diversified first into that of snowmobiles (and later skidoos, or water scooters), then into railcar and locomotive manufacture, and finally into the manufacture of small (less than 100-seat) commercial aircraft."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "981cf1d4-c078-4da5-a181-6e92f6641fe5",
                                                "sense_id": "7a1ce6fd-ac00-3d5b-90e7-05b3bfa6f3e1",
                                                "text": "Lance Allan: \"When you first saw that video of you in a snowmobile suit at five years old on national TV and on our air. Were you a little bit like, c'mon Mom and Dad, are you going to do me like that?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "snowmobile",
